If things had gone badly, you would have put your comrades in danger as well.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.640
Do not disobey your commanding officer ever again.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.360
Do you want to become an X-Rounder that badly, Asemu?

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:23.660
Well, if I don't... I'll never catch up to Dad...

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.620
That's fine, isn't it?

