If you can't become an X-Rounder, become Asemu Asuno the Super Pilot.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.830
Super Pilot?

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:39.300
It means being an awesome pilot even though you're not an X-Rounder.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.760
Like me!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:46.430
This time I defeated an X-Rounder.

