Even if you possess superior skills,

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.200
if your heart's weak and rotten, it's all for nothing.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:10.120
I told you, didn't it? That's where strong guys win in the end.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.290
Thank you, Commander!

